00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:06,240
那不是房间的一部分 只是摆摆样子而已
that's not part of the room. That's just for show.

347
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:07,900
你们不该跳进去
You're not supposed to jump in it.

348
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:09,500
我不跳了
I'm not next.

349
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:13,000
所以那不是一个可爱的兔子洞吗
So that's not a cute rabbit hole?

350
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:14,580
兔子 没有
Rabbits? No.

351
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,020
耗子倒有几只
Couple of rats, though.

352
00:17:16,500 --> 00:17:17,160
这地方真的好危险
This place is a deathtrap.

353
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:21,880
卡洛琳 拜托告诉我你没事
Caroline, please tell me you're okay.

354
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:23,760
不行 因为我有事
I can't, because I'm not.

355
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,480
我会用紧急密码放我们出去
I'll use the emergency code to get us out of here.

356
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,620
好吧 我现在真的要对你们说实话
Okay, I'm gonna be real honest with you right now.

357
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:33,680
我不知道密码是啥
I don't know the codes.

358
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:37,280
救命 下面有东西在动
Help, there's something moving down here!

359
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:38,420
我要进去
I'm going in.

360
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:40,016
苏菲 把你的胡椒喷雾手电给我
Sophie, give me the pepper spray flashlight.

361
00:17:40,016 --> 00:17:41,300
好的
All right, yeah.

362
00:17:41,300 --> 00:17:41,720
快点
Hurry!

363
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:45,340
那玩意真的好刺
That really does sting.

364
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:51,480
奥列格 吉时已到
Okay, Oleg, now it's time.

365
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:53,860
那美好的一刻又到了
It's that beautiful moment

366
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:56,040
我们又要造人了
where you and I are gonna make a baby

367
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,280
还是当着你工作伙伴的面
right in front of your coworkers.

368
00:17:59,020 --> 00:18:00,380
我们就不能有点档次
Can we have a little more class

369
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,840
等上了计程车再干吗
and wait till we get in the cab?

370
00:18:03,490 --> 00:18:04,260
什么
What?

371
00:18:04,260 --> 00:18:05,900
我们要在童话小茶杯上开干
We're gonna do it on top of teacups.

372
00:18:05,900 --> 00:18:07,646
那可是相当上档次啊
That's pretty classy.

373
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:13,380
这是什么情况
What is happening?

374
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:14,520
知道吗
You know what?

375
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,040
把那玩意喷一些到你脑子里吧
Spray some of that stuff in your mind.

376
00:18:17,207 --> 00:18:18,653
麦克斯 看
Max, look.

377
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,120
怪不得他要把腿抬到空中
Oh, that's why his leg's up in the air.

378
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:22,760
我看够了 我要走了
I've seen enough. I'm out.

379
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:29,220
我好像踩到会动的东西了
Ugh, I think I landed on what was moving.

380
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,640
所以那玩意死翘翘了
So that's dead now.

381
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,920
天啊 你没事吧
Oh, my God. Are you okay?

382
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:34,700
没事 你呢
Yeah, I think. Are you?

383
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:35,600
没事
Yeah.

384
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:38,220
等等 你刚不是说有事吗
Wait, you said you weren't okay.

385
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:40,260
我是指情绪上啊
I meant emotionally.

386
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:43,760
我居然为了你的情绪跳地板洞
I jumped into a floor hole for feelings?

387
00:18:44,300 --> 00:18:46,420
我的情绪可是相当受伤啊 麦克斯
Well, my feelings are really hurt, Max.

388
00:18:46,460 --> 00:18:47,700
整整四年呢
It's been four years.

389
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,120
我不知道该怎么做
Well, I don't know what to do,

390
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:50,980
因为就像疯帽子说
because like the Sad Hatter said,

391
00:18:51,240 --> 00:18:53,060
时光一去不复返
time goes forward; it doesn't go back.

392
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:54,680
我不能抹掉房租的事
I can't undo the rent thing.

393
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,380
我只是以为我们是同甘共苦
I just thought we were in this together,

394
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,360
是啊
We are,

395
00:18:58,560 --> 00:19:00,460
我四年前就该告诉你
and I should have told you four years ago,

396
00:19:00,460 --> 00:19:02,640
但我当时觉得我们长不过一个月
but I thought we wouldn't last a month.

397
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:05,060
但后来一个月过去了 又一个月过去了
But then we did, and then another month,

398
00:19:05,060 --> 00:19:07,380
我现在也还不知道怎么发生的
and I'm still not sure how this happened:

399
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,840
我们就成为死党了
we became best friends.

400
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:12,460
麦克斯 这是第一次不用讨好你
Max, that's the first time you've ever called me

401
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:14,380
你自愿称我为死党
your best friend without a bribe,

402
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:17,300
那比钱有价值多了
and that's worth a lot more than money,

403
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:19,140
你也知道我有多爱钱是吧
and you know how much I love money.

404
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:21,660
是啊 你差点为了钱毁了我们的友情
Yeah, you almost ruined our friendship over it.

405
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,660
好了 来吧 咱们赶紧离开这
All right, come on, let's get out of here.

406
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:27,500
我有事
I'm not okay.

407
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,740
脚剧痛 脚剧痛
Searing pain, searing pain.

408
00:19:30,800 --> 00:19:33,760
我可能跳下来的时候扭到脚踝了
Ugh, I think I twisted my ankle when I jumped down here.

409
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,740
天啊 真对不起
Oh, my God. I am so sorry.

410
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:37,160
你说得对
You're right.

411
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:39,100
有时候道歉完全没用
Sometimes sorry just doesn't cut it.

412
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:41,400
那我们要怎么把你弄出去呢
So how are we gonna get you out of here?

413
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:42,600
如果你想让我背你
If you want me to carry you,

414
00:19:42,600 --> 00:19:43,900
麻烦先把你的巨乳卸掉
you'll have to take off your boobs.

415
00:19:45,680 --> 00:19:46,860
我们应该走哪边
Which way should we go?

416
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:49,720
我的烂方向感导致我在布鲁克林当服务员
My sense of direction led me to being a waitress in Brooklyn.

417
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,680
要不就往前走吧
You know what? Let's go forward.

418
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,540
就像时间一样 只能往前不能回头
'Cause much like the time, you can't go back.

419
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:56,018
而且那会动的玩意苏醒了 看起来很生气
Also, the moving thing just came to and looks mad.

420
00:19:56,018 --> 00:19:56,769
走吧
Go.

421
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:02,100
麦克斯 我从未跟你的屁股如此靠近
Max, I've never been this close to your butt before,

422
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:03,520
你屁股真壮观啊
and it's spectacular!

423
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:04,980
你的秘密是什么
What's your secret?

424
00:20:05,820 --> 00:20:06,840
我今年27岁
I'm 27.

425
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:13,400
我真的不该看到这画面
I really shouldn't be seeing this.

426
00:20:15,080 --> 00:20:17,420
我们能把灯关掉吗
Can we please turn the lights back off?

427
00:20:18,601 --> 00:20:19,720
老天 救我
Oh, God, help me!

428
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,800
在下面有个好处就是
Well, one good thing about being down here:

429
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,540
苏菲和奥列格在上面
Sophie and Oleg are up there.

430
00:20:24,980 --> 00:20:26,120
等等 地板怎么在晃
Wait, why is the floor sagging?

431
00:20:31,686 --> 00:20:33,260
老天
Oh, my God.

432
00:20:33,260 --> 00:20:36,620
我很确定这一摔
You know, I'm pretty sure that fall

433
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:38,400
能把宝宝送进我的子宫里
knocked the baby right up into me.

434
00:20:41,540 --> 00:20:44,280
更正一下 如果我能让时光倒流
Correction, if I could turn the clock back,

435
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:45,500
我不会回到四年前
I wouldn't go back four years.

436
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:47,100
我要回到30秒前
I'd go back 30 seconds.
